    "text": "By Atlanta News First staff ,\n2 hours ago ATLANTA, Ga. (Atlanta News First) — A man was seriously injured in a shooting at a DeKalb County apartment complex Wednesday night. DeKalb County police said they responded to reports of a person shot in the 2800 block of Misty Waters Drive, at Hidden Valley Apartments in unincorporated Decatur. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
